---
import Sidebar from "./Sidebar.astro";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import type { Locale } from "../data/site";
interface Props { locale: Locale; }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const asset = (path: string) => `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/${path.replace(/^\//, "")}`;
const zh = locale === "zh";
const liveHref = "https://moat-staging.pages.dev/";
const githubHref = "https://github.com/abigailmounind/moat";
const projectHref = asset(locale === "en" ? "/#projects-moat" : "/zh/#projects-moat");
---
<div class="site-shell case-shell moat-case"><Sidebar locale={locale} mode="case" caseSlug="personal-moat" /><main class="main-column case-study">
<header class="case-hero moat-hero"><p class="eyebrow">{zh ? "独立产品案例" : "INDEPENDENT PRODUCT CASE"}</p><h1>{zh ? "人生护城河 · 人生三河" : "Personal Moat · Three Rivers of Life"}</h1><p class="lede">{zh ? "把零散的人生经历整理成可确认的证据、未来路径和长期计划，同时为未知保留空间。" : "A reflection and planning product that turns lived evidence into user-confirmed paths and long-term plans while leaving room for the unknown."}</p><div class="paper-actions"><a href={liveHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><Icon name="play" />{zh ? "打开隔离预发布" : "Open isolated staging"}</a><a href={githubHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><Icon name="github" />GitHub</a></div><div class="case-meta"><span>{zh ? "隔离预发布" : "Isolated staging"}</span><span>2026.09 — {zh ? "至今" : "Present"}</span><span>{zh ? "产品 · 体验 · 全栈 · AI" : "Product · UX · Full stack · AI"}</span></div><img class="moat-hero-image" src={asset("/images/personal-moat/product.svg")} alt={zh ? "人生三河产品框架" : "Three Rivers product framework"} /></header>
<section class="case-summary"><div><span>{zh ? "问题" : "PROBLEM"}</span><p>{zh ? "长期选择需要同时看见经历、能力、现实约束与热爱，但常见测评容易把复杂人生压缩成标签和分数。" : "Long-term decisions draw on experience, capability, constraints, and passion; common assessments often compress that complexity into labels or scores."}</p></div><div><span>{zh ? "角色" : "ROLE"}</span><p>{zh ? "独立负责产品定义、信息架构、交互视觉、前后端实现、AI 边界、测试、隐私设计和 Cloudflare 交付。" : "Independently owned product definition, IA, interaction and visual design, full-stack implementation, AI boundaries, testing, privacy, and Cloudflare delivery."}</p></div><div><span>{zh ? "结果" : "OUTCOME"}</span><p>{zh ? "形成封面 → 探索 → 我的河 → 未来路径 → 护城河计划的可保存闭环，并完成匿名主体隔离、导出与删除。" : "Delivered a saveable Cover → Explore → My River → Future Path → Moat Plan loop with anonymous-subject isolation, export, and deletion."}</p></div></section>
<section class="moat-story" id="problem"><p class="eyebrow">01 · {zh ? "问题与原则" : "PROBLEM & PRINCIPLES"}</p><h2>{zh ? "帮助用户看见积累，而不是替用户定义人生。" : "Help people see their accumulation without defining their lives."}</h2><p>{zh ? "产品明确区分用户自述、已有证据、模型提议和确认版本。未知不等于薄弱；河流、雾与地形是叙事骨架，不冒充心理测量。敏感问题可跳过，AI 失败时保留输入和确定性流程。" : "The product separates self-reported input, evidence, model proposals, and confirmed versions. Unknown does not mean weak; rivers, fog, and terrain are a narrative frame rather than a psychometric claim. Sensitive questions can be skipped, and deterministic flows preserve input when AI is unavailable."}</p></section>
<section class="moat-story" id="framework"><p class="eyebrow">02 · {zh ? "产品框架" : "PRODUCT FRAMEWORK"}</p><h2>{zh ? "恰好三条河，连接探索与长期行动。" : "Exactly three rivers connect reflection to long-term action."}</h2><div class="river-grid"><article><b>{zh ? "生存之河" : "Survival"}</b><p>{zh ? "现实约束、稳定性与可持续生活。" : "Constraints, stability, and sustainable living."}</p></article><article><b>{zh ? "能力之河" : "Capability"}</b><p>{zh ? "可以被证据支持、继续积累的能力。" : "Evidence-backed capabilities that can compound."}</p></article><article><b>{zh ? "热爱之河" : "Passion"}</b><p>{zh ? "愿意投入注意力并长期靠近的方向。" : "Directions worthy of sustained attention."}</p></article></div><p>{zh ? "五种资本——人力、社会、心理、财务、身体——作为观察维度；路径和计划只有在用户填写与确认后才进入个人地图。" : "Five capitals—human, social, psychological, financial, and physical—act as lenses. Paths and plans enter the map only after the user writes and confirms them."}</p></section>
<section class="moat-story" id="architecture"><p class="eyebrow">03 · {zh ? "架构选择" : "ARCHITECTURE"}</p><h2>{zh ? "静态体验保持轻盈，状态能力按边界接入。" : "Keep the experience light; add stateful capability behind explicit boundaries."}</h2><img class="moat-architecture" src={asset("/images/personal-moat/architecture.svg")} alt={zh ? "Cloudflare 预发布架构" : "Cloudflare staging architecture"} /><p>{zh ? "原生 JavaScript、DOM、SVG 与 CSS 承载前端。隔离环境由 Pages 通过同源 Service Binding 调用 Worker，D1 持久化匿名主体档案和工作区；AI 密钥只在服务端，调用有全局与主体限额。仓库保留 Node/PostgreSQL 参考实现，但 Cloudflare 预发布不依赖 PostgreSQL 或 Redis。" : "Vanilla JavaScript, DOM, SVG, and CSS power the frontend. In staging, Pages calls a Worker through a same-origin Service Binding; D1 persists anonymous profiles and workspaces. AI credentials stay server-side behind global and per-subject limits. A Node/PostgreSQL reference implementation remains in the repository, but Cloudflare staging does not depend on PostgreSQL or Redis."}</p></section>
<section class="moat-story" id="privacy"><p class="eyebrow">04 · {zh ? "隐私与数据边界" : "PRIVACY & DATA BOUNDARIES"}</p><h2>{zh ? "先定义不收集什么，再设计数据能力。" : "Define what not to collect before designing data capability."}</h2><ul class="moat-evidence"><li>{zh ? "随机匿名 Cookie 映射到独立 D1 主体；不同主体不能互读。" : "A random anonymous cookie maps to an isolated D1 subject; subjects cannot read one another."}</li><li>{zh ? "支持档案、工作区、导出和删除；失败日志不记录提示词、回答或敏感正文。" : "Profiles, workspaces, export, and deletion are supported; failure logs exclude prompts, answers, and sensitive body text."}</li><li>{zh ? "访客统计与个人档案分表，只保留粗粒度地点和时间；详细记录需要管理密钥。" : "Visitor statistics are separate from profiles and retain only coarse location and time; detailed records require an admin secret."}</li><li>{zh ? "匿名数据不能跨设备恢复；共享浏览器配置会共享本地数据。" : "Anonymous data cannot be recovered across devices; a shared browser profile shares local data."}</li></ul></section>
<section class="moat-story" id="delivery"><p class="eyebrow">05 · {zh ? "验证与上线判断" : "VALIDATION & RELEASE"}</p><h2>{zh ? "公开可访问，但生产与隔离预发布仍需分开描述。" : "Publicly accessible, with production and staging kept distinct."}</h2><p>{zh ? "自动测试覆盖路由、空数据、跨域拒绝、坐标处理、管理密钥和匿名主体隔离；桌面端与移动端完成过浏览器验证。当前 themoat.pages.dev 是静态公开入口，moat-staging.pages.dev 才连接隔离 Worker 与 D1。因此项目已达到公开作品与受控体验阶段，但在正式域名接入后端、确定账号迁移策略并完成真实用户验证前，不宣称全面生产上线。" : "Automated coverage includes routing, empty states, cross-origin rejection, coordinate handling, admin authorization, and anonymous-subject isolation; desktop and mobile browser checks have been performed. Today, themoat.pages.dev is a public static entry, while moat-staging.pages.dev connects the isolated Worker and D1. This is a public portfolio product and controlled experience, not a fully production-launched service until the production domain gains its backend, account migration is decided, and real-user validation is completed."}</p><div class="project-timeline-actions"><a href={liveHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">↗ {zh ? "体验隔离预发布" : "Explore isolated staging"}</a><a href={githubHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><Icon name="github" />GitHub</a></div></section>
<footer class="case-footer"><div class="actions"><a class="primary-link" href={projectHref}>← {zh ? "返回项目时间轴" : "Back to projects"}</a></div></footer>
  </main>
</div>
